{"id": "clm:549c855db7d5ab692be316d44ddebda4ba901b242fb66b6dea67d883f2fde91e", "type": "statement", "text": "The FENS release reports that mitochondria-linked gene activity differed between sexes in astrocytes and that myelin-related gene activity differed between sexes in oligodendrocytes. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-07-08)", "source_url": "https://www.fens.org/news-activities/news/why-does-parkinsons-disease-affect-more-men-than-women-study-reveals-differences-in-gene-activity-in-the-brain", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Sex, age and ancestry differences and young-onset PD"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:21d2e23a34a50a9a1867effbb320e0fc3cff9a4d64bfe85e264dc256a0bdd4e1", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:73685f41fb9607d745742c3074e6bc16e0b8d6d66f8412e2515af600f5e7b658", "ev:e82f0bf4db4efc668e534360b41e0a2b48be6a5629d4aa43e41c2a7cd296ff9c"]}
